{
  "metadata": {
    "schemaVersion": 1,
    "description": "RVCE Campus graph for Accessible Route Adviser. 23 real RVCE buildings/gates plus 1 demo-only isolated node. Building accessibility flags are from unverified student knowledge. Path distances and step-free values are demonstration data generated for this project.",
    "disclaimer": "DISCLAIMER: This is a simplified model of the RVCE campus using only main buildings and two campus gates. Building accessibility flags (entrance ramp, stairs to floors, lift to floors) are based on unverified student knowledge (dataSource: STUDENT_KNOWLEDGE) and have NOT been independently verified. Path connections, distances, and step-free statuses are DEMONSTRATION DATA and do not represent real-world measurements or accessibility surveys. No formal accessibility survey has been conducted. Do not rely on this data for actual accessibility decisions. RV University buildings (other than the shared Library) are out of scope."
  },
